  "question": {
    "text": "The number of values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;for which the system of linear equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> has no solution is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
